Portal flow (Recalled — screenshots only, not machine output):
Entra admin center, signed in as breakglass@raytakosharkygmail.onmicrosoft.com.
Enterprise applications > New application > "Create your own application" > name
"A3-nongallery-test" > "Integrate any other application you don't find in the gallery
(Non-gallery)" > Create.

SAML: Single sign-on > SAML > Basic SAML Configuration > Edit > placeholder values:
